### 6.9 Attempt to Finalise CDC Survey when Invalid (Fails with 422 Unprocessable Entity)
# If called after steps 6.4, 6.5, 6.6, or 6.7, returns 422 with validation problem details.
POST {{baseUrl}}/submissions/{{cdcSubmissionId}}/finalise
x-functions-key: {{functionKey}}


### 6.10 Finalise CDC Survey (Success: Promotes from 'payloads' to 'processed' lake storage)
# Validates complete payload through Step 1 and Step 2, stamps SHA-256 integrity hash, and promotes blob to:
# processed/urn=123456/schema=cdc_survey/v=1/{cdcSubmissionId}.json with status 'ReadyForCde'.
POST {{baseUrl}}/submissions/{{cdcSubmissionId}}/finalise
x-functions-key: {{functionKey}}
